<opsproc code="00025258.0001001" revdate="2026-08-19T10:59:35"><title>Spoilers 2 and 5</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.041"><title>Flight Preparation/Limitations</title><procbody lid="N.00025258.0001001.042"><action layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.043" memory="false"><command code="00025258.0001001.015"><para layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.044">Determine the associated Flight
Manual performance penalties with the OCTOPUS program.</para><note code="00025258.0001001.016" layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.045"><para layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.046">In the Airbus <abb>EFB</abb> <abb>PERF</abb> applications, this corresponds to the <abb>MEL</abb> item "GROUND SPOILERS 2 PAIRS INOPERATIVE".</para></note></command></action></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.053"><title>In flight</title><procbody lid="N.00025258.0001001.054"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00025258.0001001.019" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.055" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>In the case of further failure of <abb>SEC</abb> 1:</intro><procbody lid="N.00025258.0001001.056"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.057"><unlist bulltype="NDASH" code="00025258.0001001.020" layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.058"><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.059">Autoland is
not permitted.</para></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.060">Disengage the <abb>AP</abb> at <measure category="Length" show-unit="true" system="US" unit="ft">500</measure> <abb>RA</abb> before landing in direct law.
As soon as the <abb>AP</abb> is disengaged when the two <abb>SEC</abb>s are failed, it cannot be engaged again.</para></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00025258.0001001.061">Maximum landing
capability is CAT 1.</para></item></unlist></inform></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>